{"id":"f088119b0602bcd0","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-predicate-expression.md","title":"谓词表达","display":"df-predicate-expression — 谓词表达","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-predicate-expression","aliases":["91-df-predicate-expression","91-df-truth-expression","91-df-expressibility"],"display":"df-predicate-expression — 谓词表达","depends_on":["[[91-df-truth-predicate]]","[[91-df-expressive-completeness]]","[[91-df-arithmetical-hierarchy]]","[[91-df-structure]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-predicate-expression"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-predicate-expression</span><span>91-df-truth-expression</span><span>91-df-expressibility</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-predicate-expression — 谓词表达"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0838e653809dc677\" href=\"?note=0838e653809dc677\" title=\"91-df-truth-predicate\">91-df-truth-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ce2e952933d30cc2\" href=\"?note=ce2e952933d30cc2\" title=\"91-df-expressive-completeness\">91-df-expressive-completeness</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"84940566355062f6\" href=\"?note=84940566355062f6\" title=\"91-df-arithmetical-hierarchy\">91-df-arithmetical-hierarchy</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c8e718c83a9cc331\" href=\"?note=c8e718c83a9cc331\" title=\"91-df-structure\">91-df-structure</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-predicate-expression-—-谓词表达-$\\mathrm{PredExpr}$\">df-predicate-expression — 谓词表达 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PredExpr}\">\\(\\mathrm{PredExpr}\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{L}\">\\(\\mathcal{L}\\)</span> (语言)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak M\">\\(\\mathfrak M\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L\">\\(\\mathcal L\\)</span>-结构)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\subseteq|\\mathfrak M|\">\\(P\\subseteq|\\mathfrak M|\\)</span> (结构论域上的一元关系)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}predicate\\text{-}expression}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PredExpr}_{\\mathfrak M}(P,\\mathcal L)\n\\coloneqq\n\\exists\\varphi(x)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}^{1}_{\\mathcal L}\\;\n\\forall a\\in|\\mathfrak M|\\,\n\\bigl(a\\in P\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathfrak M\\models\\varphi[x\\mapsto a]\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}predicate\\text{-}expression}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PredExpr}_{\\mathfrak M}(P,\\mathcal L)\n\\coloneqq\n\\exists\\varphi(x)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}^{1}_{\\mathcal L}\\;\n\\forall a\\in|\\mathfrak M|\\,\n\\bigl(a\\in P\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathfrak M\\models\\varphi[x\\mapsto a]\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PredExpr}\">\\(\\mathrm{PredExpr}\\)</span> : 谓词在语言中可表达</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{True}_{\\mathcal{L}_0}\">\\(\\mathrm{True}_{\\mathcal{L}_0}\\)</span> : <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{L}_0\">\\(\\mathcal{L}_0\\)</span>-真理谓词</li>\n<li>可表达 : 存在公式定义谓词</li>\n</ul>\n<p>谓词表达的层次：</p>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"表格\"><table><thead>\n<tr>\n<th>谓词</th>\n<th><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{L}_0\">\\(\\mathcal{L}_0\\)</span>中可表达？</th>\n<th><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{L}_T\">\\(\\mathcal{L}_T\\)</span>中可表达？</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_n\">\\(\\Sigma_n\\)</span>-真理</td>\n<td>✓ 可</td>\n<td>✓ 可</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_n\">\\(\\Pi_n\\)</span>-真理</td>\n<td>✓ 可</td>\n<td>✓ 可</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>完全真理</td>\n<td>✗ 不可</td>\n<td>✓ 可</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div><p>表达与不可定义性：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\neg \\mathrm{PredExpr}(\\mathrm{True}_{\\mathcal{L}_0}, \\mathcal{L}_0)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\neg \\mathrm{PredExpr}(\\mathrm{True}_{\\mathcal{L}_0}, \\mathcal{L}_0)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>(Tarski不可定义定理)</p>\n<p>表达与算术层级：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"P \\in \\Sigma_n \\Rightarrow \\mathrm{PredExpr}(P, \\mathcal{L}_0)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[P \\in \\Sigma_n \\Rightarrow \\mathrm{PredExpr}(P, \\mathcal{L}_0)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>任意<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_n\">\\(\\Sigma_n\\)</span>谓词在<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{L}_0\">\\(\\mathcal{L}_0\\)</span>中可表达。</p>\n<p>真理谓词的表达能力：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{L}_T \\text{ 可表达 } \\mathrm{True}_{\\mathcal{L}_0}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal{L}_T \\text{ 可表达 } \\mathrm{True}_{\\mathcal{L}_0}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{L}_T \\text{ 可表达更多高阶断言}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal{L}_T \\text{ 可表达更多高阶断言}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>表达的扩展：</p>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"表格\"><table><thead>\n<tr>\n<th>扩展类型</th>\n<th>描述</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>语言扩展</td>\n<td>添加<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>谓词</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>定义扩展</td>\n<td>添加可表达谓词的定义</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>公理扩展</td>\n<td>添加关于谓词的公理</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div><p>表达与保守性的关系：\n若新谓词 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> 由旧语言公式作<strong>显式定义</strong>，并且只加入定义公理，则所得\n定义扩张对旧语言保守。仅仅知道 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> 可表达，并不能使任意\n“<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span>-公理”保守；附加公理仍可能翻译成新的旧语言内容。\n反之，新谓词在旧语言中不可定义也不自动导致非保守，例如 TB、UTB\n添加不可由算术定义的真理谓词，却对 PA 的算术后果保守。</p>\n<p>定义的意义：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>理解真理谓词的表达地位</li>\n<li>区分可表达与不可表达谓词</li>\n<li>连接不可定义性与表达能力</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-predicate-expression-—-谓词表达-$\\mathrm{PredExpr}$","text":"df-predicate-expression — 谓词表达 $\\mathrm{PredExpr}$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-truth-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"0838e653809dc677","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-truth-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-expressive-completeness","status":"resolved","id":"ce2e952933d30cc2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-expressive-completeness]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-arithmetical-hierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"84940566355062f6","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-arithmetical-hierarchy]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"c8e718c83a9cc331","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-structure]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{PredExpr}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{L}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak M","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L","display":false},{"tex":"P\\subseteq|\\mathfrak M|","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}predicate\\text{-}expression}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PredExpr}_{\\mathfrak M}(P,\\mathcal L)\n\\coloneqq\n\\exists\\varphi(x)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}^{1}_{\\mathcal L}\\;\n\\forall a\\in|\\mathfrak M|\\,\n\\bigl(a\\in P\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathfrak M\\models\\varphi[x\\mapsto a]\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PredExpr}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{True}_{\\mathcal{L}_0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{L}_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{L}_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{L}_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pi_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg \\mathrm{PredExpr}(\\mathrm{True}_{\\mathcal{L}_0}, \\mathcal{L}_0)","display":true},{"tex":"P \\in \\Sigma_n \\Rightarrow \\mathrm{PredExpr}(P, \\mathcal{L}_0)","display":true},{"tex":"\\Sigma_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{L}_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{L}_T \\text{ 可表达 } \\mathrm{True}_{\\mathcal{L}_0}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal{L}_T \\text{ 可表达更多高阶断言}","display":true},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"P","display":false},{"tex":"P","display":false},{"tex":"P","display":false}],"bytes":2635,"backlinks":[{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-67","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-CT.md]]\n[[91-df-FS-n.md]]\n[[91-df-FS.md]]\n[[91-df-KF-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-KF.md]]\n[[91-df-T-closure.md]]\n[[91-df-T-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-TB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-TB.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB.md]]\n[[91-df-VF.md]]\n[[91-df-adequacy-conditions-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-adequacy-conditions.md]]\n[[91-df-arithmetical-hierarchy.md]]\n[[91-df-capture-axiom.md]]\n[[91-df-classical-extension.md]]\n[[91-df-compositional-axioms.md]]\n[[91-df-compositional-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-conjunction-axiom.md